{
 "voice": "kokoro-82M am_michael x1.0",
 "lines": [
  {
   "line": 1,
   "text": "One small feature takes ten steps, eight tools, and hours of coordination.",
   "start": 0.002,
   "end": 4.958,
   "u0": 0.0,
   "u_end": 9.91
  },
  {
   "line": 2,
   "text": "Most of it isn't judgment. It's busywork.",
   "start": 5.377,
   "end": 8.066,
   "u0": 10.75,
   "u_end": 16.13
  },
  {
   "line": 3,
   "text": "Meet AAVA 3.0: an agentic assistant that starts the work before you do.",
   "start": 8.502,
   "end": 13.696,
   "u0": 17.0,
   "u_end": 27.39
  },
  {
   "line": 4,
   "text": "It picks up your tickets, and pulls context from the tools you already use.",
   "start": 14.002,
   "end": 18.62,
   "u0": 28.0,
   "u_end": 37.24
  },
  {
   "line": 5,
   "text": "By the time you look, the work is built, tested, and ready for review.",
   "start": 20.502,
   "end": 24.469,
   "u0": 41.0,
   "u_end": 48.93
  },
  {
   "line": 6,
   "text": "Every step is on the record: what it read, what it built, what it checked.",
   "start": 25.377,
   "end": 29.601,
   "u0": 50.75,
   "u_end": 59.2
  },
  {
   "line": 7,
   "text": "On the right, the canvas holds the work itself.",
   "start": 30.127,
   "end": 32.775,
   "u0": 60.25,
   "u_end": 65.55
  },
  {
   "line": 8,
   "text": "The live preview.",
   "start": 33.002,
   "end": 34.14,
   "u0": 66.0,
   "u_end": 68.28
  },
  {
   "line": 9,
   "text": "The code.",
   "start": 34.377,
   "end": 35.127,
   "u0": 68.75,
   "u_end": 70.25
  },
  {
   "line": 10,
   "text": "A terminal.",
   "start": 35.502,
   "end": 36.259,
   "u0": 71.0,
   "u_end": 72.51
  },
  {
   "line": 11,
   "text": "Every change.",
   "start": 36.627,
   "end": 37.555,
   "u0": 73.25,
   "u_end": 75.11
  },
  {
   "line": 12,
   "text": "And the whole run, mapped step by step.",
   "start": 37.877,
   "end": 40.06,
   "u0": 75.75,
   "u_end": 80.12
  },
  {
   "line": 13,
   "text": "And when a decision is yours, it stops, and asks. Never earlier. Never later.",
   "start": 42.002,
   "end": 46.86,
   "u0": 84.0,
   "u_end": 93.72
  },
  {
   "line": 14,
   "text": "Ten steps become a few. All in one place.",
   "start": 50.502,
   "end": 53.255,
   "u0": 101.0,
   "u_end": 106.51
  },
  {
   "line": 15,
   "text": "AAVA does the heavy lifting. You make the decisions.",
   "start": 56.502,
   "end": 59.529,
   "u0": 113.0,
   "u_end": 119.05
  }
 ]
}
